WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.536
Oh no!

2
00:00:02.090 --> 00:00:06.465
Cups are selling so fast, Maya cannot catch the cards as they come!

3
00:00:07.019 --> 00:00:10.285
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

4
00:00:10.839 --> 00:00:13.174
This is Episode 82.

5
00:00:13.728 --> 00:00:15.615
Meet the river chute.

6
00:00:16.169 --> 00:00:20.226
Every new card floats down, one after another, in order.

7
00:00:20.780 --> 00:00:22.973
The lamp reads them on the way.

8
00:00:23.527 --> 00:00:26.794
Count, count, count, as they go by.

9
00:00:27.349 --> 00:00:28.870
More cups?

10
00:00:29.424 --> 00:00:31.346
The river gets wider.

11
00:00:31.900 --> 00:00:35.178
Two lanes, three lanes, nothing bumps.

12
00:00:35.732 --> 00:00:39.753
At the end, every card lands in the basket, still in order.

13
00:00:40.307 --> 00:00:43.975
The notes flow like a river, live, as things happen.

14
00:00:44.529 --> 00:00:46.946
That is Amazon Kinesis.

15
00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:50.861
It carries a live stream of data the moment it is made.

16
00:00:51.415 --> 00:00:53.561
Now you know the river chute!

17
00:00:54.115 --> 00:00:57.700
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

